      - research first → reason matches research-before-prose

      Each fixture has all three pairs present and correctly
      matched, only the ORDER is wrong. Asserts
      `result.kind === "malformed-body"` and the reason equals
      the expected string literally.

- [x] 3h. Add a new test group: "nested marker rejection". A
